                <td>2.57x</td>
                <td>₹46,260</td>
                <td>₹90,978</td>
                <td>₹1,44,177</td>
                <td>Maintains statistical parity with the hike ratio of the 7th CPC.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Maximum Staff Representation</strong></td>
                <td>2.86x</td>
                <td>₹51,480</td>
                <td>₹1,01,244</td>
                <td>₹1,60,446</td>
                <td>Demanded by confederations to reflect private sector urban parity.</td>
              </tr>
